@startuml
!include common-style.puml

title Deployment Diagram - Local Development Environment

left to right direction

actor "Developer / Operator" as Dev #DBEAFE

node "Local Machine\nWindows / macOS / Linux" as Local #F8FAFC {
  node "Web Browser\nChrome / Edge" as Browser #FFFFFF {
  }

  node "Frontend Dev Server\nReact + Vite\nhttp://localhost:5173" as FE #DBEAFE {
    artifact "React SPA\nTypeScript + Tailwind" as ReactApp
    artifact "TanStack Query\nZustand store" as StateLayer
  }

  node "Backend API Server\nNestJS\nhttp://localhost:3000" as BE #CCFBF1 {
    artifact "Swagger UI\nhttp://localhost:3000/api/docs" as Swagger #F1F5F9
    artifact "JWT Guard + Roles Guard\nRBAC middleware" as Guards #FEF9C3
    artifact "Prisma Client\nORM layer" as PrismaClient #FEF9C3
  }

  database "PostgreSQL Database\nlocalhost:5432\nclinic_management_db" as DB #F3E8FF

  artifact "Prisma Migrate\nnpx prisma migrate dev" as Migrate #FEF9C3
  artifact "Seed Script\nnpx prisma db seed" as Seed #FEF9C3
  artifact "Prisma Studio\nnpx prisma studio :5555" as Studio #F1F5F9
}

Dev --> Browser : access app via browser
Dev --> FE : npm run dev (port 5173)
Dev --> BE : npm run start:dev (port 3000)
Dev --> Migrate : setup/update schema
Dev --> Seed : create 8 demo accounts + data
Dev --> Studio : inspect and edit data

Browser --> FE : HTTP
FE --> BE : HTTPS / JSON REST\nBearer Token\n/api/v1/*
BE --> Swagger : serves API docs at /api/docs
BE --> Guards : authenticate + authorize
BE --> PrismaClient : database access
PrismaClient --> DB : SQL queries
Migrate --> DB : apply migrations
Seed --> DB : insert demo records
Studio --> DB : view / edit data

note bottom of Local
Deployment scope: local / development only.
NOT included in current version:
- Docker / docker-compose
- CI/CD pipeline (.github/workflows/)
- Production server
- HTTPS certificate
- Load balancer
end note

@enduml
